{"work_id": "MX4-069", "matched_key": "友谊还是侵略", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "友谊还是侵略1507本原则包括门户开放主义尊重中国行政和领土的完整以及反对任何外国控制中国等等杀死几百万中国人不为别的第一为了门户开放第二为了尊重中国行政和领土的完整第三为了反对任何外国控制中国现在只有广州台湾等处一小片地方的门户还向艾奇逊们开放着第一个神圣的原则在那里依然维持着其余的地方比如上海吧解放以后本来是开放的现在却被人用美国的军舰和军舰上所装的大炮实行了一条很不神圣的原则门户封锁现在只有广州台湾等处一小片地方的行政和领土还算叨了艾奇逊第二个神圣原则的光依然维", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-980973716441b9197629", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/36e607c0457c68b8f6cca39f64231ccb9989/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "c4ad80b15f7c7bde2dac26caec6024460d6775ac4c04a8a0c17b3dc6f45c201c", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 4, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 397, "end": 397, "record_path": "archive/records/A-980973716441b9197629.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-980973716441b9197629.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第四卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-335fea191226d1fd", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX4-069", "matched_key": "友谊还是侵略", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "友谊还是侵略一九四九年八月三十日中文马克思主义文库毛泽东友谊还是侵略一九四九年八月三十日为了寻找侵略的根据艾奇逊重复地说了一大堆友谊加上一大堆原则艾奇逊说从我们历史很早的时期起美国人民和政府就关心中国了虽然距离遥远背景又大不相同把中美两国隔离开了可是那些在宗教慈善事业和文化方面团结中美两国人民的纽带一直在加深着美国对中国的友谊许多年来种种善意措施便是证据例如用庚子赔款来教育中国学生在第二次世界大战期间废除治外法权以及战时和战后对中国的大规模援助等等美国始终维持并且现在", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-f5933da357615c1049fc", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/marxist.org-chinese-mao-19490830.htm", "raw_sha256": "764e15fb023b5c7f81ceb0e077f74dc24124155e6324399b039978a9d0d25618", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mia-catalogue", "volume": 4, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end": 48, "record_path": "archive/records/A-f5933da357615c1049fc.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-f5933da357615c1049fc.txt", "source_title": "友谊还是侵略", "source_media": "html", "source_layer": "web_transcription", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-8f9c34bbe68b55d2", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX4-069", "matched_key": "友谊还是侵略", "normalized_offset": 7, "normalized_context": "1五评白皮书i友谊还是侵略2美国人民与政府中国等丨从我们历史很早的时期起美国人民和政府就关心中国了虽然距离遥远背景又大不相同把中美两国隔离开了可是那些在宗教慈善事业和文化方面团结中美两国人民的纽带一直在加深着美国对中国的友谊许多年来种种善意措施便是证据例如用庚子赔款来教育中国学生在第一一次世界大战期间废除治外法杈以及战时和战后对中国的大规模援助等等美国始终维持并且现在依然维持对华外交政策的各项基本原则包括门户开放主义尊重中国行政和领土的完整以及反对任何外国控制中国等等这是有案可稽的", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-3ae8064b9aa1cb037b87", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/10.pdf", "raw_sha256": "6de60e351c9597e21d8ccea11e6011ed0a7a0911a980057a73f12e011df78f3f", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-ji-10", "volume": 10, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 343, "end": 343, "record_path": "archive/records/A-3ae8064b9aa1cb037b87.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-3ae8064b9aa1cb037b87.txt", "source_title": "第十卷", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "mia_collected", "id": "C-79eae60d9afa5c9d", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
